>How about "virtual dimen"s, that only get defined when the user needs them,
>for instance, when assigning to them?

Problem is that this only works if the first use of the dimen is an
assignment.  If it is to read from the dimen, you get a `Missing
number, treated as zero' error.  It may be possible to code round
this, but I wouldn't like to bet on it :-)

